{
  "info": {
    "name": "今晚播什麼？後端 API",
    "description": "規格見 backend/API.md。先在 DB 執行 db/schema.sql 與 db/seed-test.sql。\n\nbirthmsg 每分鐘限 3 次，1～5 資料夾連續跑會撞到 429。本機測試建議：\n1. 啟動後端時設 SETTING_CACHE_SECONDS=5，讓設定改了馬上生效。\n2. DB 執行 update \"WOT_Setting\" set \"value\"='100' where \"type\"='api' and \"name\"='birthmsg.perMinute';\n3. 跑 1～5、7 資料夾。\n4. 改回 '3'，等 1 分鐘，再單獨跑 6「頻率限制」。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. start",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "開始時間記入",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"isSuccess = true\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().isSuccess).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/start",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "start"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
